&h=200&blur=200&s=7627d1a46793b8867ab2f033088a831c 3x"}, "body": "That series of pitch-black silhouette-skinned figures and animals was just too good to pass up!\nI would love for you to draw my original character Safartha.\nhttps://www.pixiv.net/artworks/90110760\n\nSpace, night sky and comet motifs.\nThe mother is a man-eating beast (https://www.pixiv.net/artworks/88239982), so the image is somewhat like being among livestock.\n(I'd be happy if the mother was also with him, but it's a core design, so I won't say it's impossible. ......!)\nI'm not sure if he's a human, a beast, or a monster.\n\nI'll leave the rest of the composition to you. I'm not sure if this is a good idea or not.\nI look forward to working with you. ......!", "nc": 16, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}], "sent_works": [], "similar_creators": [{"id": 105538, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "蟹江", "screen_name": "metyayurusu", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1607625673048477697/N-HO6Aj3.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1027539084074307584/1751106210/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": 86, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 120, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}], "nc": 160}, {"id": 1231824, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": false, "name": "野生に帰りました", "screen_name": "m2_inko", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1768246755844616192/AUTIuk5t.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1334076308230262784/1710417881/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 60, "skills": [{"genre": "